        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The Company and the Union agree to establish deductions for COPE effective March 1, 1991 in accordance with the following:",
            "block_bbox": [
                179,
                448,
                1030,
                508
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    179.0,
                    448.0
                ],
                [
                    1030.0,
                    448.0
                ],
                [
                    1030.0,
                    508.0
                ],
                [
                    179.0,
                    508.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. The Company agrees to deduct and transmit to the treasurer of Local Union 986 I.B.E.W. the amount specified on the IBEW-COPE Deduction Authorization Card forms from the wages of those employees who voluntarily authorize such contributions on the forms provided for that purpose by Local Union 986 I.B.E.W. These transmittals shall occur monthly and shall be accompanied by a list of the names of those employees for whom such deductions have been made and the amount deducted for each such employee. Said deductions shall be made from the second payroll period in each month.",
            "block_bbox": [
                179,
                532,
                1043,
                786
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    179.0,
                    532.0
                ],
                [
                    1043.0,
                    532.0
                ],
                [
                    1043.0,
                    786.0
                ],
                [
                    179.0,
                    786.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. Upon receipt of a written request addressed to the Company and signed by the employee, revoking that employee's authorization for deduction of IBEW-COPE, the Company will, beginning with the first calendar month after receiving such written authorization, discontinue said deduction.",
            "block_bbox": [
                172,
                809,
                1049,
                923
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    172.0,
                    809.0
                ],
                [
                    1049.0,
                    809.0
                ],
                [
                    1049.0,
                    923.0
                ],
                [
                    172.0,
                    923.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. Such authorization for IBEW-COPE deduction shall be in the appropriate form of Exhibit A which is attached hereto and made a part hereof.",
            "block_bbox": [
                172,
                946,
                1046,
                1005
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    172.0,
                    946.0
                ],
                [
                    1046.0,
                    946.0
                ],
                [
                    1046.0,
                    1005.0
                ],
                [
                    172.0,
                    1005.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. IBEW-COPE deductions shall be suspended during periods of leave-of-absence, layoff, or for periods of insufficient earnings.",
            "block_bbox": [
                256,
                1030,
                1026,
                1088
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 9,
            "group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    256.0,
                    1030.0
                ],
                [
                    1026.0,
                    1030.0
                ],
                [
                    1026.0,
                    1088.0
                ],
                [
                    256.0,
                    1088.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4. The Union agrees that the Company assumes no responsibility in connection with deduction of IBEW-COPE except that of forwarding monies deducted as set forth in this Memorandum of Agreement. The Union shall indemnify the Company and save harmless from any and all claims against the Company by an employee or employees for amounts deducted and withheld from earnings as aforesaid.",
            "block_bbox": [
                170,
                1112,
                1038,
                1281
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 10,
            "group_id": 9,
            "block_polygon_points": [
